Future-abstinence forecasting remains excluded, explicitly preserved under RO010/019;
current discomfort, learned consumption harm and future expected discomfort must not
be treated as equivalent. Public integration is not general biological identity learning.

RO008/009/010/011/012/015/019/020 remain conditional or active at their existing scope;
RO021 final historical reconciliation remains mandatory. The132-clause denominator
does not change simply because the biological integration seam closes.
